Linear extension for Tezbar
==========================

This standalone Rust extension is based on the MIT-licensed Linear extension
for Raycast by the Linear team, Thomas Lombart, and original contributors.

Pinned upstream commit:
https://github.com/raycast/extensions/tree/7ad5b7f3b32d2168eab8c7d4ea6001cede9a2ba8/extensions/linear

Copyright (c) 2021 Raycast. See LICENSE and the original Store manifest for the
