Linear trademarks and logos remain the property of their respective owners.

The packaged resources preserve the original extension icon, SVGs, media,
and AI configuration/skill source for provenance. SOURCE.json identifies every
upstream file by Git blob ID and SHA-256. The executable uses Rust and the
Tezbar external extension protocol. See licenses/DEPENDENCIES.json and the
individual notices for third-party Rust dependencies.
